# Oblivion Ring's two linked abilities (CR 607.2a, 400.7): it exiles Bot2's Ornithopter, which has a +1/+1 counter from
# Snakeskin Veil (the only other nonland permanent, so the lone target). When Bot2's Disenchant destroys the Ring,
# its leaves ability returns the exiled card to the battlefield under its owner's control: a new object, with no counter
# (CR 122.2: counters cease to exist when the permanent changes zones, the Oblivion Ring ruling).

